[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这天，诊所的医生似乎为了参加学会而离开了小岛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"护士也跟着一起去了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，今天诊所里只有住院的患者在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我等这一天已经等了很久了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这没有人来妨碍的一天！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1199"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“你有什么企图？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1198"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"瞥了苍一眼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“你想对睡着的苍做什么!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“你要偷跑吗！趁我还没法自由行动的时候！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“至少在我看得到的地方搞！最好是睡在我旁边！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1199"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“蓝……我说，苍教你的睡眠学习有不少负面影响呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“算了，我稍微出去一会儿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“唉……你到底打算干什么？”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1198"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嘿嘿……现在不管做什么都没人管。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“禽……禽兽……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10662"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你这话说的。这是一直和苍一起寻找七影蝶的稻荷。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“名字是之前就听说过了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“不过……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10630"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1199"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“狸猫？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我很同意你的疑问，但它是狐狸。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10632"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就算这里的医生再怎么宽容，把野生狐狸带到医院来也肯定会被骂吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，我想这家伙肯定也很想见苍。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10662"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭，嘭！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1198"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稻荷飞扑到床上，开始在苍的脸上舔来舔去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……狗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，狐狸。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10634"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭……嘭？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许是不管怎么舔苍也没有任何反应的原因吧，稻荷一脸不可思议地看向我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……她在睡觉呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10630"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稻荷开始在苍的身上蹭来蹭去，前脚则在苍软软的脸颊上按了又按。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……嘶……嘶……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10653"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对着完全没有反应的苍，稻荷脸上露出了悲伤的表情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我还想，稻荷来了的话说不定会醒来呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看来不行吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“不过，阿苍说的梦话越来越多了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“这是不是，脑内的整理正在消化中的意思？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一定是这样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我勉强地挤出了一丝笑容。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i512"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当天晚上――"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和稻荷一起，来到了山里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了将山中祭典所使用的吊灯供奉到祠堂里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蓝发现七影蝶的时候一起带到了病房里来，一直没有动过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稻荷在前面带着路，我们俩走在山路上。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"途中稻荷发现了新的七影蝶。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"试着将灯笼提起来引诱蝴蝶，一下子就跟着过来了。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哼嗯，我也能引导七影蝶呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没有必要像苍一样去触摸它们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就这样带去御神木那里就行了对吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许，这才是山祭真正的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这才是正确的做法吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10673"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，走吧。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i287"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最后带了两只七影蝶过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"确认到蝴蝶们飞移到御神木之后，我将吊灯笼供奉到了祠堂里。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i99"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样就行了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我抬起了头，再次望向御神木。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i287"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"七影蝶们还在御神木的周围飞舞着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“花瓣……差不多都掉完了……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i99"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"长在迷橘树上的白色小花，零零散散地落在周围的地面上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍确实说过，山祭的时间只限于迷橘的花盛开的期间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“已经快结束了吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不只是祭典的时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"同时也代表着这个暑假也临近结束了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……暑假结束之后，我必须得回家才行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不得不……离开这座岛……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i512"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在那之前醒过来吧，苍……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"抬头望去，月光只是在天边静静地点亮着夜空……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]